==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Aggron|125}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion; both cards have the Giga Impact attack.
*{{m|Giga Impact}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Aggron}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

